    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>As our store also sell on amazon, we do receive returns from the customers by stating reason as \"No longer needed\" called as AMZN-NLN. The products sold in this collection are in almost new - 100% working condition. So, here is an opportunity for our customers to experience the best at deeply discounted prices :)</strong></span></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YDZqRbHPZLY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong><span>Description:<br></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>Supports 4K resolution and H.265/H.264 decoding, high-definition imaging effect.</span></p>\n<p><span>2GB/4GB RAM and 16G/32G/64G ROM, ultra-large capacity allows you to enjoy more pleasure.</span></p>\n<p><span>RK3318 processor ensures more smooth and flexible operation.</span></p>\n<p><span>2.4GHz Wi-Fi brings you high-speed wireless transfer experience.</span></p>\n<p><span>You can enjoy high-definition image at home.</span></p>\n<p><span>And it is reliable and safe to use in your home.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Specifications:<br></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>CPU: RK3318 Quad-Core 64bit Cortex-A53</span></p>\n<p><span>GPU: Penta-Core Mali-450 Up to 750Mhz+</span></p>\n<p><span>O.S: Android 11 The latest Android set-top box system, is more stable, safer and more energy efficient</span></p>\n<p><span>Storage: RAM 2G/4G ROM 16G/32G/64G</span></p>\n<p><span>Wireless: 2.4G&amp;5G Wifi</span></p>\n<p><span>USB: 1 High speed USB 3.0 \uff0c1 USB 2.0</span></p>\n<p><span>Bluetooth: BT4.0</span></p>\n<p><span>LAN: Ethernet:10/100M standard RJ-45</span></p>\n<p><span>HDMI-compatible: HDMI 2.0a up to 4K@60fps</span></p>\n<p><span>3D: Hardward 3D graphics acceleration</span></p>\n<p><span>Support Decoder format:</span></p>\n<p><span>4K VP9 Video decoder, H.265/H.264 video decoder</span></p>\n<p><span>1080P other video decoders (VC-1, MPEG-1/2/4, VP6/8)</span></p>\n<p><span>Support Media format</span></p>\n<p><span>Avi/Ts/Vob/Mkv/Mov/ISO/wmv/asf/flv/dat/mpg/mpeg</span></p>\n<p><span>Support Music format</span></p>\n<p><span>MP3/WMA/AAC/WAV/OGG/DDP/HD/FLAC/APE</span></p>\n<p><span>Support Photo format</span></p>\n<p><span>HD JPEG/BMP/GIF/PNG/TIFF</span></p>\n<p><span>Mouse/ Keyboard: Support mouse and keyboard via USB;Support 2.4GHz wireless mouse and keyboard via 2.4GHz USB dongle</span></p>\n<p><span>Language: English Russian French German Spanish Portuguese Italian etc multilateral languages</span></p>\n<p><span>There are Three Options for H96 MAX V11 Box:</span></p>\n<p><span>2GB 16GB Android 11 4k@60Hz 2.4G&amp;5.8G Wifi</span></p>\n<p><span>4GB 32GB Android 11 4k@60Hz 2.4G&amp;5.8G Wifi</span></p>\n<p><span>4GB 64GB Android 11 4k@60Hz 2.4G&amp;5.8G Wifi</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Package Included:<br></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1* Tv box</span></p>\n<p><span>1* Remote control</span></p>\n<p><span>1*Ppower cable</span></p>\n<p id=\"combine-desc-images\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/RslG0z32wb9AY8NPuWjRDSScurBG2haxyFHYseBD4wD2sWz0vfOnTvYim7xkad8_bFpnQtkk6HBgLgResxNdBaqjz9XfUw6kurAkjxwWMBqjX5ftTkioSq3TDyKcWr7AlgYszyUjHXtqVjhh3fNP-_nk7Ts38SCc5xiWv72eKHTWs6mQPXHQMaPpHnG_08LJsk-msjuRbo1kENQdrdfjyE8xs9cDzojGD4LUYlc8o6-CumjY9gN3xH3n_p8XiJY88O2Wk1R1pmdIFSfqOQGHiyq7lnfSdUZyYBRsTOj_YecC8Z6MYzoTijkPMKnoPu9ojAGPlbQd0qSXPkoNAg2frjjasJAH3QlivxFapoDw8cHIPjyiwz86movCA4mnTly44_75dTlFyuCfH6Tqzd67JAZyD7QzksRCEljKJ1pvqgtKN8FCTGt5YqWAXOc4gWahdUkrlVLqtQr0y26z-hX_USRru5GLggHo3oc8mRgdt_TuT9gOUfbmHTfBFHUaOEsTJZfX_pfg6ekWhGMNaLfuKD9Kp55imOjFAqDYEksIClC_FOkLx_lP8BIK8e3nb5gE40PUmRm8_e7tlctaUINBiZQMUaZsiu2z5BUgC7hruLYIn2BvrPAnKn7zrVIOQGBg-m2EMF41B_T7Razk3REiSLgzPObsW1BQ8hMad_fU9KJtrrZw4ySIYU5JQ6A